<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Regency Realty started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Regency Realty started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Regency Realty Corp as a market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Regency was unchanged at 27-1/4.</p>
</text>
